block.text:
The user wants to try the Valorant skin instead of the Overwatch skin. I need to swap the skin in the index.html: remove the Overwatch style block and inject the Valorant CSS instead.

Plan:
1. Read the current index.html to see the exact style block
2. Replace the Overwatch style content with Valorant CSS content (keep the same `<style id="dsh-skin-valorant">` — I could change the id too for clarity, but changing id is fine)
